    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertigo Rush is a virtual reality racing experience that combines speed and parkour in an intense physical challenge. Players control agile robots, propelling them through vast, detailed environments by moving their own arms in a heart-pumping race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the mechanics of classic arcade racing games, each level is crafted to test player\u2019s skill and endurance as they race through Haven's floating cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Competitive Online Multiplayer up to 12 Players in Each Race with Global Ranking System, Time Trial Mode, Character &amp; Robot Customization and Cross-Platform Play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Polished full-body physical control for high-speed parkour racing, with fluid and satisfying movement mechanics (jumps, climbing, running) designed for an exhilarating VR experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Immersive and emotionally engaging narrative: In a world divided between floating opulence and terrestrial struggle, two ingenious siblings defy their destiny in robot races to save themselves from oppression and rewrite their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertigo Rush is a virtual reality racing experience that combines speed and parkour in an intense physical challenge. Players control agile robots, propelling them through vast, detailed environments by moving their own arms in a heart-pumping race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the mechanics of classic arcade racing games, each level is crafted to test player\u2019s skill and endurance as they race through Haven's floating cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Competitive Online Multiplayer up to 12 Players in Each Race with Global Ranking System, Time Trial Mode, Character &amp; Robot Customization and Cross-Platform Play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Polished full-body physical control for high-speed parkour racing, with fluid and satisfying movement mechanics (jumps, climbing, running) designed for an exhilarating VR experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Immersive and emotionally engaging narrative: In a world divided between floating opulence and terrestrial struggle, two ingenious siblings defy their destiny in robot races to save themselves from oppression and rewrite their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
